Having regard to the totality of the facts and circumstances of the case, keeping in view the fact that the challan has already filed in this matter and conclusion of trial of the case is likely to take time;
but, without expressing any opinion on the merits of the case, I deem it just and proper to grant bail Manish Kumar vs State Of Rajasthan on 7 November, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/77609364/
1 to the petitioner under Section 483 of BNSS.
